I come to my room.
I sit on the chair.
There is one laptop on the desk.
I open the laptop.
I make a video call.
My family is in Mexico.
What time is it there?
Here in Mumbai, it is morning now.
Today is Sunday.
But in Mexico, it is evening.
There, it is Saturday.
I wait.
My sister is there.
Her name is Sofia.
My brother is also there.
His name is Diego.
Finally, one picture comes on the laptop.
I see my home!
